  "idea": "Automated supplier price monitoring to protect profit margins",
  "text": "Stop manually re-entering Shopify customer addresses into your print-on-demand dashboard. Typing customer shipping data into supplier portals during sales spikes creates catastrophic delivery backlogs. Typos in street addresses delay printing queues and ruin your store's reputation with first-time buyers. Integrate the Gelato API directly with your Shopify storefront to automatically route verified orders to local production hubs. This slashes delivery times while giving you your weekends back.",
